OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few light well scattered
OL,6,Fshowers appearing, but otherwise a
OL,7,Fmostly dry day, with occasional
OL,8,Fbrighter spells. West to southwest
OL,9,Fwinds fresh, occasionally strong
OL,10,Facross Shetland during the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud thickening from the
OL,13,Fwest during the evening, with and area
OL,14,Fof rain spreading to all overnight, as
OL,15,Fwinds back southerly and increase
OL,16,Fstrong to near gale.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
