OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FWet, windy through the
OL,6,Fmorning with outbreaks heavy at times.
OL,7,FWinds easing fresh to strong while
OL,8,Fveering west to northwest early
OL,9,Fafternoon, bringing largely dry,
OL,10,Foccasionally sunny fare.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,13,Fmainly dry with light winds and
OL,14,Foccasional sunny spells. Monday wet
OL,15,Fand windy. Tuesday showery.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
